EXTRACTION REPORT - ONE-TAIL (SHUKAKU)
Status: COMPLETE, with note.

Target: Gaara, jinchuriki of the One-Tail, Shukaku - and at the time the Fifth
Kazekage of Sunagakure. First beast taken on the Leader's ordered sequence.

Operation: Deidara infiltrated the village by air on his explosive clay, drew Gaara
out, and after a prolonged aerial battle disabled him. Sasori held the perimeter.
The host was carried to the Rain chamber for sealing.

Extraction: full ten-ring seal, three days and nights. Shukaku drawn into the Gedo
Statue; first eye open. The host did not survive the process.

Note: an outside party - a Leaf retrieval team and a Sand elder - reached the chamber
and revived the host after extraction. The beast remains ours; the shell was returned
to life by others. Security around future sealing sites to be tightened accordingly.
